agents/gemini_cli.py adapts the runner pattern of clink in PAL MCP Server by
BeehiveInnovations (https://github.com/BeehiveInnovations/pal-mcp-server):
subprocess with `-o json`, JSON error recovery, roles as prompt files, and the
<SUMMARY> output cap. PAL MCP Server is licensed under the Apache License 2.0;
a copy is in licenses/PAL-MCP-SERVER-APACHE-2.0.txt.

Changes made here: no --yolo; sandbox on; a policy file that allows only tests
and read-only git; work happens in a clone with no remote; the privacy map and
a pushed-commits check gate every run; the output is a patch.

